{"availability":"available","full":"Morrison-Lab/gha","name":"gha","description":"Central reusable GitHub Actions workflows + composite actions for d-morrison/UCD-SERG/ucdavis R-package and Quarto repos","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":2,"created":"2026-06-14T00:43:06Z","updated":"2026-10-05T23:43:25Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://morrison-lab.github.io/gha/","topics":[],"demo":"https://morrison-lab.github.io/gha/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T14:48:39.934Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T14:48:39.934Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T14:48:39.934Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T14:48:39.934Z","stars":1,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Central, reusable GitHub Actions for d-morrison / UCD-SERG / ucdavis R-package and Quarto repositories. Modeled on r-lib/actions and easystats/workflows: repos call a reusable workflow with a tiny stub instead of carrying their own copy.","This repo is public so it can be referenced from repositories across the d-morrison, ucdavis, UCD-SERG, UCLA-PHP, and UCD-IDDRC owners.","The vendor's own action is proprietary: its action.yml carries a commercial EULA header, and its README states GITLEAKSLICENSE is \"required for organizations, not required for user accounts\". Every consumer of this repo is an organization. The gitleaks CLI is MIT, so the composite installs the official release binary instead. Integrity comes from one pinned constant: the release's own checksums.txt is fetched and compared against the checksums-sha256 input, and only then trusted to verify the platform tarball -- one value covering every architecture. Bump version and checksums-sha256 together."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Morrison-Lab/gha/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"49bfd88707ef0c232bbc8515309989bbc61b3cd00ca133f2b2624f5559f2dd13","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T14:48:40.152Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07